IMPORT prelude

§ `Penal Code 1871 -- shared domain`

-- Ontology for the encoding of Penal Code 1871 (2020 Revised Edition,
-- current version as at 09 Sep 2026). Source: registers/source-bundle/PC1871.txt.
-- This module owns the nouns. Rule modules import these types and never redeclare them.
-- INERT STYLE. No field name contains an apostrophe: 's is L4's projection operator.

§§ `Place of an act -- sections 2, 3, 4, 4A, 4B`

DECLARE Place IS ONE OF
    `wholly in Singapore`
    `wholly outside Singapore`
    `partly in Singapore`

§§ `Remote communication -- section 416B(2)`

DECLARE `Remote Channel` IS ONE OF
    `not remote`
    `the Internet`
    `telephone or other communication device`
    `television or radio`
    `other electronic or other technology for facilitating communication`

§§ `Actor -- sections 11, 21, 4, 4A, 82, 83, 84`

DECLARE Actor HAS
    `name` IS A STRING
    `age in years` IS A NUMBER
    `is a citizen or permanent resident of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a public servant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is acting or purporting to act in the course of employment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has sufficient maturity of understanding` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is of unsound mind at the time of the act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of unsoundness of mind is incapable of knowing the nature of the act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of unsoundness of mind is incapable of knowing the act is wrong by the ordinary standards of reasonable and honest persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of unsoundness of mind is incapable of knowing the act is wrong as contrary to law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by reason of unsoundness of mind is completely deprived of any power to control his actions` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Fault -- sections 23, 24, 25, 26, 26B, 26C, 26D`

DECLARE Fault HAS
    `intends to cause wrongful gain to self or another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to cause wrongful loss to another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended gain is of property to which the gainer is not legally entitled` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended gain is the avoidance of a loss of property which the avoider is not legally entitled to avoid` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended gain is by unlawful means` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended loss is of property to which the loser is legally entitled` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended loss is an exposure to the risk of a loss` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended loss is by unlawful means` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act is dishonest by the ordinary standards of reasonable and honest persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the actor knows the act is dishonest by those standards` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to deceive another person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that an advantage accrue or a detriment befall by means of the deception` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the intended advantage or detriment is so slight that no reasonable person would complain` IS A BOOLEAN
    `does the act deliberately` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has sufficient cause to believe the relevant circumstance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is aware that the relevant circumstance exists or is virtually certain to exist` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is wilfully blind to the relevant circumstance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is done or believed without due care and attention` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intended to cause the effect by the means employed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knew or had reason to believe the means employed were likely to cause the effect` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows there is a real risk that the relevant circumstance exists or will exist` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows there is a real risk that the effect will be caused` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it would have been unreasonable to have taken that risk` IS A BOOLEAN
    `omits to do an act which a reasonable person would do` IS A BOOLEAN
    `does an act which a reasonable person would not do` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Deception -- sections 415, 416, 416B, 417, 418, 419, 420`

DECLARE Deception HAS
    `deceives a person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `deception was the sole or main inducement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a dishonest concealment of facts` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a mere breach of contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the deceived is a company association or body of persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an individual officer employee or agent of the deceived was personally deceived` IS A BOOLEAN
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `fraudulently or dishonestly induces consent that any person retain property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally induces an act or omission the deceived would not otherwise do` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to body` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to mind` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to reputation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that act or omission causes or is likely to cause damage or harm to property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `pretends to be some other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knowingly substitutes one person for another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `represents that a person is a person other than that person really is` IS A BOOLEAN
    `remote channel` IS A `Remote Channel`
    `the deception is conducted mainly by way of remote communication` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows the cheating is likely to cause wrongful loss to a person whose interest the actor was bound to protect` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly induces delivery of property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of the whole or any part of a valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly induces the making altering or destroying of anything signed or sealed and capable of being converted into a valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Personal information -- section 416A`

DECLARE `Personal Information Dealing` HAS
    `the information is personal information about an individual` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the actor knows or has reason to believe it was obtained without that individual consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `obtains or retains the personal information` IS A BOOLEAN
    `supplies offers transmits or makes available the personal information` IS A BOOLEAN
    `purpose is use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `purpose is supply for use in committing or facilitating an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe it will be or is likely to be used to commit or facilitate an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `merely provides or operates network access or routing facilities` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Services -- section 420A`

DECLARE `Services Obtained` HAS
    `obtains services for self or another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the services are made available on the basis that payment has been is being or will be made` IS A BOOLEAN
    `obtains the services without payment or without payment in full` IS A BOOLEAN
    `when obtaining knows they are or might be made available on that payment basis` IS A BOOLEAN
    `when obtaining intends that payment will not be made or will not be made in full` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Fraud by representation -- sections 424A and 424B`

DECLARE `Fraud Conduct` HAS
    `makes a false representation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `fails to disclose information which the actor is under a legal duty to disclose` IS A BOOLEAN
    `abuses a position expected to safeguard the financial interests of another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the representation is untrue or misleading` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the actor knows it is or might be untrue or misleading` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the representation is submitted to a system or device designed to receive communications` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is directly connected with a written or oral contract for the supply of goods or services` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the acts were material` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Property taking -- sections 378 and 403`

DECLARE `Property Taking` HAS
    `the property is movable` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to take the property out of the possession of any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `without that person consent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `moves the property in order to such taking` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly misappropriates or converts movable property to own use` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 380, 381 and 382 -- aggravated theft
    `the theft is committed in a building tent or vessel used as a human dwelling or for the custody of property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is a clerk or servant or employed in the capacity of a clerk or servant and the property is in the possession of his master or employer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `having made preparation for causing death hurt or restraint or fear of death hurt or restraint to any person in order to commit the theft or to effect escape after it or to retain property taken by it` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 404 -- misappropriation of property of a deceased person
    `knows that the property was in the possession of a deceased person at the time of that person decease and has not since been in the possession of any person legally entitled to it` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Trust -- section 405`

DECLARE Trust HAS
    `is entrusted with property or with any dominion over property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly misappropriates or converts that property to own use` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly uses or disposes of that property in violation of a direction of law or legal contract touching the trust` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally suffers any other person to do so` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 407, 408 and 409 -- the aggravated criminal breaches of trust
    `the entrustment was of property for the purpose of transportation or storage for hire` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused is an employee or engaged in a capacity with the same fundamental qualities as an employee and was entrusted in that capacity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused was entrusted in his capacity as a public servant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused was entrusted in the way of his trade profession or business as a banker merchant factor broker attorney or agent` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused was entrusted in his professional capacity otherwise than by way of such a trade profession or business` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused was entrusted in his capacity as a director of a corporation an officer of an unincorporated association a partner in a partnership a key executive or a fiduciary` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Extortion -- Chapter 17, sections 383 to 389`

DECLARE Extortion HAS
    -- Section 383 -- extortion
    `intentionally puts any person in fear of any harm to that person or to any other person in body mind reputation or property whether the harm is to be caused legally or illegally` IS A BOOLEAN
    `thereby dishonestly induces the person so put in fear to deliver to any person any property or valuable security or anything signed or sealed which may be converted into a valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 385, 387 and 389 -- putting in fear in order to commit extortion
    `in order to commit extortion puts or attempts to put any person in fear` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 386 to 389 -- the kinds of fear that aggravate
    `the fear is of death or of grievous hurt to that person or to any other` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the fear is of an accusation against that person or any other of having committed or attempted to commit an offence punishable with death with imprisonment for life or with imprisonment which may extend to 10 years` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the fear is of an accusation of having attempted to induce any other person to commit such an offence` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Robbery and gang-robbery -- Chapter 17, sections 390 to 402`

DECLARE Robbery HAS
    -- Section 390(2) -- when theft is robbery
    `in order to commit the theft or in committing it or in carrying away or attempting to carry away property obtained by it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `for that end voluntarily causes or attempts to cause to any person death hurt or wrongful restraint or fear of instant death instant hurt or instant wrongful restraint` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 390(3) -- when extortion is robbery
    `at the time of committing the extortion the offender is in the presence of the person put in fear` IS A BOOLEAN
    `commits the extortion by putting that person in fear of instant death instant hurt or instant wrongful restraint to that person or to some other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by so putting in fear induces the person then and there to deliver up the thing extorted` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 391 -- gang-robbery
    `5 or more persons conjointly commit or attempt to commit the robbery or the persons so committing or attempting together with those present and aiding amount to 5 or more` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 393, 394, 396 and 397 -- the aggravated robberies
    `attempts to commit robbery` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in committing or attempting to commit the robbery voluntarily causes hurt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is jointly concerned in committing or attempting to commit the robbery` IS A BOOLEAN
    `one of the 5 or more persons conjointly committing the gang-robbery commits murder in so committing it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `at the time of committing or attempting to commit the robbery the offender is armed with or uses any deadly weapon` IS A BOOLEAN
    `at that time the offender causes grievous hurt to any person or attempts to cause death or grievous hurt to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 399 to 402 -- preparation, gangs and assembly
    `makes any preparation for committing gang-robbery` IS A BOOLEAN
    `belongs to a gang of persons associated for the purpose of habitually committing gang-robbery` IS A BOOLEAN
    `belongs to a gang of persons associated for the purpose of habitually committing theft or robbery and not being gang-robbers` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is one of 5 or more persons assembled for the purpose of committing gang-robbery` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Stolen property -- Chapter 17, sections 410 to 414`

DECLARE `Stolen Property` HAS
    -- Section 410 -- stolen property
    `the possession of the property has been transferred by theft extortion or robbery or the property has been criminally misappropriated or is property in respect of which criminal breach of trust or cheating has been committed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the transfer misappropriation breach of trust or cheating was committed within or without Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the property has since come into the possession of a person legally entitled to the possession of it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the property is property into or for which stolen property has been converted or exchanged or anything acquired by such conversion or exchange` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 411 to 414 -- receiving, dealing in, and concealing
    `receives or retains the property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `habitually receives or deals in the property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `voluntarily assists in concealing or disposing of or making away with the property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe the property to be stolen property or property obtained in whole or in part through an offence involving fraud or dishonesty` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe the possession of the property to have been transferred by the commission of gang-robbery` IS A BOOLEAN
    `receives the property from a person whom he knows or has reason to believe to belong or to have belonged to gang-robbers and knows or has reason to believe the property to have been stolen` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the accused proves a reasonable excuse to receive or retain the property and that he exercised reasonable care as soon as practicable after acquiring that knowledge or reason to believe` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Fraudulent deeds and dispositions -- Chapter 17, sections 421 to 424`

DECLARE `Fraudulent Deed` HAS
    -- Sections 421 to 424 -- fraudulent deeds and dispositions
    `dishonestly or fraudulently removes conceals or delivers to any person or transfers or causes to be transferred to any person without adequate consideration any property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intending thereby to prevent or knowing it to be likely that he will thereby prevent the distribution of that property according to law among his creditors or the creditors of any other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly or fraudulently prevents any debt or demand due to himself or to any other person from being made available according to law for payment of his debts or the debts of that other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly or fraudulently signs executes or becomes a party to any deed or instrument which purports to transfer or subject to any charge any property or any interest in it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the deed or instrument contains a false statement relating to the consideration for the transfer or charge or relating to the person for whose use or benefit it is really intended to operate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly or fraudulently conceals or removes any property of himself or any other person or assists in the concealment or removal of it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly releases any demand or claim to which he is entitled` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Mischief -- Chapter 17, sections 425 to 440`

DECLARE Mischief HAS
    -- Section 425 -- mischief
    `with intent to cause or knowing that he is likely to cause wrongful loss or damage to the public or any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `causes the destruction of any property or such change in any property or in the situation of it as destroys or diminishes its value or utility or affects it injuriously` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 427, 428 and 435 to 440 -- the aggravated mischiefs
    `the act causes or the accused knows it is likely to cause a disruption to the provision of any key service` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act causes or the accused knows it is likely to cause a disruption to the performance of any duty or function of or the exercise of any power by the Government or a public agency` IS A BOOLEAN
    `commits the mischief by killing poisoning maiming or rendering useless any animal` IS A BOOLEAN
    `commits the mischief by fire or any explosive substance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intending to cause or knowing it to be likely that he will thereby cause damage to any property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intending to cause or knowing it to be likely that he will thereby cause the destruction of a building ordinarily used as a place of worship for the administration of justice for the transaction of public affairs for education or art for public use or ornament as a human dwelling or as a place for the custody of property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `commits the mischief to any decked vessel or any vessel of a burden of 20 tons or upwards intending to destroy or render unsafe or knowing it to be likely that he will thereby destroy or render unsafe that vessel` IS A BOOLEAN
    `commits or attempts to commit that mischief to the vessel by fire or any explosive substance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally runs any vessel aground or ashore intending to commit theft of property contained in it or dishonestly to misappropriate any such property or with intent that such theft or misappropriation may be committed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `having made preparation for causing to any person death hurt or wrongful restraint or fear of death hurt or wrongful restraint` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Criminal trespass -- Chapter 17, sections 441 to 462`

DECLARE Trespass HAS
    -- Section 441 -- criminal trespass
    `enters into or upon property in the possession of another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `having lawfully entered into or upon such property unlawfully remains there` IS A BOOLEAN
    `with intent to commit an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `with intent to intimidate insult or annoy any person in possession of the property` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 442 -- house-breaking
    `the property entered or remained in is a building tent container or vessel used as a human dwelling or a building used as a place for worship or as a place for the custody of property` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 449 to 452 -- house-breaking for a purpose, or after preparation
    `commits the house-breaking in order to commit an offence punishable with death` IS A BOOLEAN
    `commits the house-breaking in order to commit an offence punishable with imprisonment for life` IS A BOOLEAN
    `commits the house-breaking in order to commit an offence punishable with imprisonment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `having made preparation for causing hurt to any person for assaulting any person for wrongfully restraining any person or for putting any person in fear of hurt assault or wrongful restraint` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 453 -- possession of house-breaking implements or offensive weapons
    `is found armed with any instrument for shooting stabbing or cutting or any instrument which used as a weapon of offence is likely to cause death without lawful authority or a lawful purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is found having his face covered or otherwise disguised with intent to commit any offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is found equipped with any article or instrument for use in the course of or in connection with any house-breaking` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 459 to 462 -- hurt in house-breaking, and closed receptacles
    `while committing the house-breaking causes grievous hurt to any person or attempts to cause death or grievous hurt to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `at the time of the house-breaking a person guilty of it voluntarily causes or attempts to cause death or grievous hurt to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is jointly concerned in committing the house-breaking` IS A BOOLEAN
    `dishonestly or with intent to commit mischief breaks open or unfastens any closed receptacle which contains or which he believes to contain property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is entrusted with that closed receptacle without having authority to open it` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Document making -- sections 463 and 464`

DECLARE `Document Making` HAS
    `makes a document or electronic record or part of one` IS A BOOLEAN
    `makes signs seals executes or affixes an electronic signature` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends it to be believed that it was made signed sealed executed or affixed by or by the authority of a person by whom the actor knows it was not` IS A BOOLEAN
    `without lawful authority alters a document or electronic record in any material part` IS A BOOLEAN
    `causes a person who does not know the contents to sign seal execute or alter` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to cause damage or injury to the public or to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to support any claim or title` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to cause any person to part with property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to cause any person to enter into any express or implied contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intent to commit fraud or that fraud may be committed` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Forged documents, false instruments and accounts -- Chapter 18, sections 466 to 477A`

DECLARE `Forged Document` HAS
    -- Sections 466 and 467 -- the descriptions of document that aggravate forgery (ss 466, 467), possession (s 474) and counterfeit seals or marks (ss 472, 475)
    `the document or electronic record purports to be a record or proceeding of or before a court of justice or a register of birth baptism marriage or burial or a register kept by a public servant as such or a certificate document or electronic record purporting to be made by a public servant in his official capacity or an authority to institute or defend a suit or to take any proceedings in it or to confess judgment or a power of attorney` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the document purports to be a valuable security or a will or an authority to adopt a child or purports to give authority to any person to make or transfer any valuable security or to receive the principal interest or dividends on it or to receive or deliver any money movable property or valuable security or purports to be an acquittance or receipt acknowledging the payment of money or the delivery of any movable property or valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 468 and 469 -- the purposes that aggravate forgery
    `intends that the document or electronic record forged shall be used for the purpose of cheating` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that the document or electronic record forged shall harm the reputation of any person or knows that it is likely to be used for that purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 470 -- a forged document
    `the document or electronic record is a false document or false electronic record made wholly or in part by forgery` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 471 and 474 -- using or possessing a forged document
    `uses as genuine a document or electronic record` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe the document or electronic record to be a forged document or forged electronic record` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has in his possession a document or electronic record knowing it to be forged` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that the document or electronic record shall fraudulently or dishonestly be used as genuine` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 472 and 473 -- counterfeit seals, plates and instruments for making an impression
    `makes or counterfeits any seal plate or other instrument for making an impression` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has in his possession any such seal plate or other instrument knowing it to be counterfeit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that the seal plate or instrument shall be used for the purpose of committing a forgery which would be punishable under section 467` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that the seal plate or instrument shall be used for the purpose of committing a forgery which would be punishable under a section of Chapter 18 other than section 467` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 473A and 473B -- equipment for making a false instrument
    `makes or has in his custody or under his control a machine or implement or paper or other material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `to his knowledge the machine implement paper or material is or has been specifically designed or adapted for the making of any false instrument` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the machine implement paper or material is or has been specifically designed or adapted for the making of any instrument` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that he or another person makes a false instrument using the machine implement paper or material in order to induce another person to accept it as genuine or to induce a machine to respond to it as if it were a genuine instrument` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that by reason of so accepting it the person induced does or does not do some act` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 473C -- prejudice
    `the act or omission intended to be induced will result in a person permanently or temporarily losing property including by not getting what he might get` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission intended to be induced will result in a person being deprived of an opportunity to earn remuneration or greater remuneration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission intended to be induced will result in a person being deprived of an opportunity to gain a financial advantage otherwise than by way of remuneration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission intended to be induced will result in somebody being given an opportunity to earn remuneration or greater remuneration from a person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission intended to be induced will result in somebody being given an opportunity to gain a financial advantage from a person otherwise than by way of remuneration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission intended to be induced will be the result of a person having accepted a false instrument as genuine in connection with his performance of any duty` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission intended to be induced is one induced by a machine responding to the instrument as if it were genuine` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act intended to be induced is one the person has an enforceable duty to do or the omission intended to be induced is of an act the person is not entitled to do` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 475 and 476 -- counterfeit authenticating devices and marks
    `counterfeits upon or in the substance of any material any device or mark used for the purpose of authenticating a document or electronic record` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has in his possession any material upon or in the substance of which any such device or mark has been counterfeited` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that the device or mark shall be used for the purpose of giving the appearance of authenticity to any document or electronic record then forged or thereafter to be forged on that material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the device or mark is used for the purpose of authenticating a document described in section 467` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 477 -- cancelling, destroying or secreting a will or valuable security
    `cancels destroys or defaces or attempts to cancel destroy or deface or secretes or attempts to secrete a document or commits mischief in respect of it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the document is or purports to be a will or an authority to adopt a child or any valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN
    `with intent to cause damage or injury to the public or to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 477A -- falsification of accounts
    `is a clerk officer or servant or is employed or acting in the capacity of a clerk officer or servant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally and with intent to defraud destroys alters conceals mutilates or falsifies any book electronic record paper writing valuable security or account or a set of them which belongs to or is in the possession of his employer or has been received by him for or on behalf of his employer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally and with intent to defraud makes or abets the making of any false entry in or omits or alters or abets the omission or alteration of any material particular from or in any such book electronic record paper writing valuable security or account or set of them` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Currency and bank notes -- Chapter 18, sections 489A to 489I`

DECLARE Currency HAS
    -- Section 489A(2) -- what the thing is
    `the thing is a bank note being a promissory note or engagement for the payment of money to bearer on demand issued by a person carrying on the business of banking in any part of the world or issued by or under the authority of the government of any country or territory and intended to be used as equivalent to or as a substitute for money` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing is currency including a currency note or coin which is legal tender in the country or territory in which it is issued` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing is a coin being metal used as money stamped and issued by or under the authority of the government of any country or territory in order to be so used` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 489A -- forging or counterfeiting
    `forges or counterfeits or knowingly performs any part of the process of forging or counterfeiting the currency or bank note` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 489B and 489C -- dealing in and possessing forged or counterfeit currency
    `the currency or bank note is forged or counterfeit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe the currency or bank note to be forged or counterfeit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `delivers or sells to or buys or receives from any other person or otherwise imports exports or traffics in or uses as genuine the currency or bank note` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has the currency or bank note in his possession` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to use the currency or bank note as genuine or that it may be used as genuine` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 489D -- instruments and materials
    `makes mends or performs any part of the process of making or mending or buys sells or disposes of or has in his possession any die machinery instrument or material` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the die machinery instrument or material is for the purpose of being used or he knows or has reason to believe that it is intended to be used for forging or counterfeiting any currency or bank note` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 489E -- abetting counterfeiting abroad
    `the accused is within Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the thing abetted is the counterfeiting of currency out of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 489F and 489G -- operations on coin and currency
    `performs on the coin an operation which diminishes its weight or alters its composition` IS A BOOLEAN
    `performs on the currency an operation which alters its appearance` IS A BOOLEAN
