§§ `Unlawful assembly -- Chapter 8, sections 141 to 158`

DECLARE `Unlawful Assembly` HAS
    -- Section 141 -- what makes an assembly unlawful
    `the assembly is of 5 or more persons` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the common object is to overawe by criminal force or show of criminal force the Legislative or Executive Government or any public servant in the exercise of his lawful power` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the common object is to resist the execution of any law or of any legal process` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the common object is to commit any offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the common object is by criminal force or show of criminal force to any person to take or obtain possession of property or to deprive any person of the enjoyment of a right of way or of the use of water or other incorporeal right in his possession or enjoyment or to enforce any right or supposed right` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the common object is by criminal force or show of criminal force to compel any person to do what he is not legally bound to do or to omit to do what he is legally entitled to do` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 142 -- membership
    `is aware of facts which render the assembly an unlawful assembly` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally joins the assembly or continues in it` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 144, 148 and 158 -- armed
