    `knows that the unlawful assembly has been commanded in the manner prescribed by law to disperse` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the assembly is of 5 or more persons likely to cause a disturbance of the public peace` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the assembly has been lawfully commanded to disperse and the person knowingly joins or continues in it after the command` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 146 -- rioting
    `force or violence is used by the assembly or by any member of it in prosecution of the common object` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 149 -- offence committed in prosecution of the common object
    `an offence is committed by a member of the assembly in prosecution of the common object or such as the members knew to be likely to be committed in prosecution of that object` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is a member of the same assembly at the time that offence is committed` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 150 -- hiring
