    -- Section 152 -- assaulting or obstructing a public servant suppressing a riot
    `assaults or threatens to assault or obstructs or attempts to obstruct a public servant in the discharge of his duty in endeavouring to disperse an unlawful assembly or to suppress a riot or an affray or uses or threatens or attempts to use criminal force to such public servant` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 153 -- provocation with intent to cause a riot
    `intentionally or rashly by doing anything which is illegal gives provocation to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends or knows it to be likely that the provocation will cause the offence of rioting to be committed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offence of rioting is committed in consequence of the provocation` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 154 to 156 -- owners, occupiers, beneficiaries and their agents
