    `he or his agent or manager gives the earliest notice in his power to the principal officer at the nearest police station` IS A BOOLEAN
    `he or his agent or manager having reason to believe the offence is about to be committed uses all lawful means in his power to prevent it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `he or his agent or manager in the event of the offence taking place uses all lawful means in his power to disperse or suppress it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a riot is committed for the benefit or on behalf of a person who is the owner or occupier of land respecting which the riot takes place or who claims an interest in the land or in the subject of the dispute which gave rise to the riot or who has accepted or derived any benefit from it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the agent or manager of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `he or his agent or manager has reason to believe that the riot was likely to be committed or that the unlawful assembly by which it was committed was likely to be held` IS A BOOLEAN
    `he or his agent or manager uses all lawful means in his power to prevent the riot or assembly from taking place and to suppress and disperse it` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 157 -- harbouring hired persons
