    `wears any garb or carries any token resembling any garb or token used by that class of public servants` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that it may be believed or knows it to be likely to be believed that he belongs to that class of public servants` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Contempts of the lawful authority of public servants -- Chapter 10, sections 172 to 190`

DECLARE `Contempt Of Authority` HAS
    `the person is an individual` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 172 -- absconding
    `absconds in order to avoid being arrested on a warrant or served with a summons notice or order proceeding from a public servant legally competent as such to issue it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the summons notice order or proclamation is to attend in person or by agent before a court or to produce a document or electronic record before a court` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 173 -- preventing service
    `intentionally prevents the serving on himself or on any other person of a summons notice or order proceeding from a public servant legally competent as such to issue it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally prevents the lawful affixing to any place of such a summons notice or order or intentionally removes it from a place to which it is lawfully affixed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally prevents the lawful making of a proclamation under the authority of a public servant legally competent as such to direct it` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 174 -- failure to attend
    `is legally bound to attend in person or by agent at a certain place and time in obedience to a summons notice order or proclamation proceeding from a public servant legally competent as such to issue it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally omits to attend at that place or time or departs from the place before the time at which it is lawful to depart` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 175 -- omission to produce
    `is legally bound to produce or deliver up a document or electronic record to a public servant as such` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally omits to produce or deliver up the document or electronic record` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 176 and 177 -- notice and information
    `is legally bound to give a notice or to furnish information on any subject to a public servant as such` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally omits to give the notice or furnish the information in the manner and at the time required by law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is legally bound to furnish information on any subject to a public servant as such` IS A BOOLEAN
    `furnishes as true information on the subject which he knows or has reason to believe to be false` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice or information respects the commission of an offence or is required to prevent the commission of an offence or in order to the apprehension of an offender` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 178 to 181 -- oaths, answers, signatures and false statements
    `refuses to bind himself by an oath to state the truth when required so to bind himself by a public servant legally competent to require it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is legally bound to state the truth on any subject to a public servant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `refuses to answer a question demanded of him touching that subject by that public servant in the exercise of his legal powers` IS A BOOLEAN
    `refuses to sign a statement made by him when required to sign it by a public servant legally competent to require it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is legally bound by an oath to state the truth on any subject to a public servant or other person authorised by law to administer such oaths` IS A BOOLEAN
    `makes to that public servant or person touching that subject a statement which is false and which he knows or believes to be false or does not believe to be true` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 182 -- false information to a public servant
    `gives to a public servant information which he knows or believes to be false` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends thereby to cause or knows it to be likely that he will thereby cause the public servant to use his lawful power to the injury or annoyance of any person or to do or omit anything which he ought not to or would not do or omit if the true state of facts were known to him` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 183 to 185 -- property taken or sold by lawful authority
    `offers resistance to the taking of property by the lawful authority of a public servant knowing or having reason to believe that the person is such public servant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally obstructs a sale of property offered for sale by the lawful authority of a public servant as such` IS A BOOLEAN
    `at a sale of property held by the lawful authority of a public servant as such purchases or bids for property on account of himself or another person whom he knows to be under a legal incapacity to purchase that property at that sale` IS A BOOLEAN
    `at such a sale bids for property not intending to perform the obligations under which he lays himself by the bidding` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 186 and 187 -- obstruction and omission to assist
    `voluntarily obstructs a public servant in the discharge of his public functions` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is bound by law to render or furnish assistance to a public servant in the execution of his public duty` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally omits to give that assistance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the assistance was demanded by a public servant legally competent to demand it for executing a process lawfully issued by a court or preventing the commission of an offence or suppressing a riot or an affray or apprehending a person charged with or guilty of an offence or escaped from lawful custody` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 188 -- disobedience to a promulgated order
    `knows that by an order promulgated by a public servant lawfully empowered to promulgate it he is directed to abstain from a certain act or to take certain order with certain property in his possession or under his management` IS A BOOLEAN
    `disobeys that direction` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the disobedience causes or tends to cause obstruction annoyance or injury or risk of obstruction annoyance or injury to any person lawfully employed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the disobedience causes or tends to cause danger to human life health or safety or causes or tends to cause a riot or an affray` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 189 and 190 -- threats of injury
    `holds out a threat of injury to a public servant or to a person in whom he believes that public servant to be interested` IS A BOOLEAN
    `for the purpose of inducing the public servant to do any act or to forbear or delay to do any act connected with the exercise of his public functions` IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds out a threat of injury to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `for the purpose of inducing that person to refrain or desist from making a legal application for protection against any injury to a public servant legally empowered as such to give or cause such protection` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `False evidence -- Chapter 11, sections 191 to 200`

DECLARE `False Evidence` HAS
    -- Section 191 -- giving false evidence
    `is legally bound by an oath or by an express provision of law to state the truth or is bound by law to make a declaration upon any subject` IS A BOOLEAN
    `makes a statement verbally or otherwise which is false and which he knows or believes to be false or does not believe to be true` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 192 -- fabricating false evidence
    `causes a circumstance to exist or makes a false entry in a book record or electronic record or makes a document or electronic record containing a false statement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that the circumstance false entry or false statement may appear in evidence in a judicial proceeding or in a proceeding taken by law before a public servant as such or before an arbitrator` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that it so appearing may cause a person who in that proceeding is to form an opinion upon the evidence to entertain an erroneous opinion touching a point material to the result of the proceeding` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 193 -- the punishment and its judicial-proceeding split
    `the false evidence is given or fabricated intentionally` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the false evidence is given in or fabricated for use in a stage of a judicial proceeding including a trial before a court martial and an investigation directed by law preliminary to or directed by a court of justice` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 194 and 195 -- intent to procure a conviction
    `intends thereby to cause or knows it to be likely that he will thereby cause a person to be convicted of an offence which is capital` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an innocent person is convicted and executed in consequence of the false evidence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends thereby to cause or knows it to be likely that he will thereby cause a person to be convicted of an offence which is not capital but punishable with imprisonment for 7 years or upwards` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offence of which conviction is intended is punishable with imprisonment for life` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 196 -- using false evidence
    `corruptly uses or attempts to use as true or genuine evidence any evidence which he knows to be false or fabricated` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 197 and 198 -- false certificates
    `issues or signs a certificate required by law to be given or signed or relating to a fact of which such certificate is by law admissible in evidence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or believes that the certificate is false in a material point` IS A BOOLEAN
    `corruptly uses or attempts to use such a certificate as a true certificate knowing it to be false in a material point` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 199 and 200 -- declarations receivable as evidence
    `makes or subscribes a declaration which a court of justice or a public servant or other person is bound or authorised by law to receive as evidence of any fact` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in the declaration makes a statement which is false and which he knows or believes to be false or does not believe to be true touching a point material to the object for which the declaration is made or used` IS A BOOLEAN
    `corruptly uses or attempts to use as true such a declaration knowing it to be false in a material point` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Offences against public justice -- Chapter 11, sections 201 to 229`

DECLARE `Public Justice` HAS
    -- The gravity of the offence concerned, for ss 201, 211 to 216, 221, 222 and 225
    `the offence concerned is punishable with death` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offence concerned is punishable with imprisonment for life or with imprisonment which may extend to 20 years` IS A BOOLEAN
