    `intends to prevent the document or electronic record from being produced or used as evidence before that court or public servant or does so after having been lawfully summoned or required to produce it for that purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 204A -- perverting the course of justice
    `does an act that has a tendency to obstruct prevent pervert or defeat the course of justice` IS A BOOLEAN
