    `the act is a mere warning to a witness that he may be prosecuted for perjury if he gives false evidence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows that the act is likely to obstruct prevent pervert or defeat the course of justice` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to obstruct prevent pervert or defeat the course of justice` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 204B -- bribery of witnesses
    `gives confers or procures or promises or offers to give confer or procure or attempts to procure any gratification to upon or for any person upon an agreement or understanding that a person aware of an offence which any person is legally bound to give information respecting will abstain from reporting it to the police or an agency charged by law with investigating offences` IS A BOOLEAN
    `gives confers or procures or promises or offers to give confer or procure or attempts to procure any gratification to upon or for any person upon an agreement or understanding that a person called or to be called as a witness in a judicial proceeding will give false testimony or withhold true testimony or abstain from giving evidence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `attempts by any means to induce a person called or to be called as a witness in a judicial proceeding to give false testimony or withhold true testimony or abstain from giving evidence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `asks receives or obtains or agrees or attempts to receive or obtain any property or benefit for himself or any other person upon an agreement or understanding that a person will as a witness in a judicial proceeding give false testimony or withhold true testimony or abstain from giving evidence` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 205 -- false personation in a suit
    `falsely personates another` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in that assumed character makes an admission or statement or confesses judgment or causes process to be issued or becomes bail or security or does any other act in a suit or criminal prosecution` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 206 to 210 -- fraud on forfeiture, execution and decrees
    `removes conceals transfers or delivers to any person any property or interest in property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `accepts receives or claims any property or interest in property knowing that he has no right or rightful claim to it or practises any deception touching any right to property or an interest in property` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends thereby to prevent the property or interest from being taken as a forfeiture or in satisfaction of a fine under a sentence pronounced or which he knows to be likely to be pronounced by a court of justice or other competent authority or from being taken in execution of a decree or order or under or pursuant to an enforcement order made or which he knows to be likely to be made by a court of justice in a civil suit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `causes or suffers a decree or order to be passed against him at the suit of any person for a sum not due or for a larger sum than is due or for property or an interest in property to which that person is not entitled or causes or suffers a decree or order to be executed or enforced against him after it has been satisfied or for anything in respect of which it has been satisfied` IS A BOOLEAN
    `obtains a decree or order against any person for a sum not due or for a larger sum than is due or for property or an interest in property to which he is not entitled or causes a decree or order to be executed or enforced against any person after it has been satisfied or for anything in respect of which it has been satisfied or suffers or permits any such act to be done in his name` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 211 -- false charge
    `intends to cause injury to a person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `institutes or causes to be instituted a criminal proceeding against that person or falsely charges that person with having committed an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows that there is no just or lawful ground for the proceeding or charge against that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the criminal proceeding is instituted on a false charge of an offence punishable with death or with imprisonment for 7 years or upwards` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 212 to 216B -- harbouring and screening offenders
    `an offence has been committed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the person is the offender` IS A BOOLEAN
    `harbours or conceals that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `accepts or agrees to accept or attempts to obtain any gratification for himself or any other person or any restitution of property to himself or any other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in consideration of his concealing an offence or of his screening a person from legal punishment for an offence or of his not proceeding against a person for the purpose of bringing him to legal punishment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `gives or causes or offers or agrees to give or cause any gratification to any person or to restore or cause the restoration of any property to any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in consideration of that person concealing an offence or screening a person from legal punishment for an offence or not proceeding against a person for the purpose of bringing him to legal punishment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the offence may lawfully be compounded` IS A BOOLEAN
    `takes or agrees or consents to take any gratification for himself or any other person under pretence or on account of helping a person to recover movable property of which he has been deprived by an offence punishable under this Code` IS A BOOLEAN
    `uses all means in his power to cause the offender to be apprehended and convicted of the offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a person convicted of or charged with an offence and in lawful custody for it has escaped from that custody or a public servant in the exercise of his lawful powers has ordered a person to be apprehended for an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows of the escape or of the order for apprehension` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to prevent that person from being apprehended` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that persons are about to commit or have recently committed robbery or gang-robbery` IS A BOOLEAN
    `harbours those persons or any of them` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to facilitate the commission of the robbery or gang-robbery or to screen those persons or any of them from punishment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `supplies the person with shelter food drink money clothes arms ammunition or means of conveyance or assists the person in any way to evade apprehension` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 217 to 223 -- public servants
    `is a public servant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knowingly disobeys a direction of the law as to the way in which he is to conduct himself as a public servant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends thereby to save or knows it to be likely that he will thereby save a person from legal punishment or subject him to a lesser punishment than that to which he is liable or intends to save or knows that he is likely thereby to save property from forfeiture or a charge to which it is liable by law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is charged as a public servant with the preparation of a record or other writing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `frames the record or writing in a manner which he knows to be incorrect` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to cause or knows it to be likely that he will thereby cause loss or injury to the public or to any person or intends thereby to save or knows it to be likely that he will thereby save a person from legal punishment or intends to save or knows that he is likely thereby to save property from forfeiture or other charge to which it is liable by law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `corruptly or with intent to cause injury to any person makes or pronounces in any stage of a judicial proceeding a report order verdict or decision which he knows to be contrary to law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is in an office that gives him legal authority to commit persons for trial or to confinement or to keep persons in confinement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `corruptly or with intent to cause injury to any person commits a person for trial or to confinement or keeps a person in confinement in the exercise of that authority` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows that in doing so he is acting contrary to law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is legally bound as a public servant to apprehend or to keep in confinement a person charged with or liable to be apprehended for an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is legally bound as a public servant to apprehend or to keep in confinement a person under sentence of a court of justice for an offence or lawfully committed to custody` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally omits to apprehend that person or intentionally suffers that person to escape or intentionally aids that person in escaping or attempting to escape from confinement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is legally bound as a public servant to keep in confinement a person charged with or convicted of an offence or lawfully committed to custody` IS A BOOLEAN
    `negligently suffers that person to escape from confinement` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 224 to 225C -- resistance, escape and rescue
    `intentionally offers resistance or illegal obstruction to his own lawful apprehension for an offence with which he is charged or of which he has been convicted or escapes or attempts to escape from custody in which he is lawfully detained for such an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally offers resistance or illegal obstruction to the lawful apprehension of another person for an offence or rescues or attempts to rescue another person from custody in which that person is lawfully detained for an offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `is legally bound as a public servant to apprehend or to keep in confinement a person in a case not provided for in section 221 222 or 223 or in any other law for the time being in force` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentionally or negligently omits to apprehend that person or suffers him to escape from confinement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in a case not provided for in section 224 or 225 or in any other law for the time being in force intentionally offers resistance or illegal obstruction to the lawful apprehension of himself or of another person or escapes or attempts to escape from custody in which he is lawfully detained or rescues or attempts to rescue another person from custody in which that person is lawfully detained` IS A BOOLEAN
    `does anything which by a law in force in Singapore he is prohibited from doing or omits to do anything which he is so enjoined to do` IS A BOOLEAN
    `no special punishment is provided by the law for the commission or omission` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 228 and 229 -- insult to a public servant sitting judicially, personation of an assessor
    `intentionally offers insult or causes interruption to a public servant while sitting in any stage of a judicial proceeding or conducting a mediation or other alternative dispute resolution process under written law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by personation or otherwise intentionally causes or knowingly suffers himself to be returned empanelled or sworn as an assessor in a case in which he knows that he is not entitled by law to be so returned empanelled or sworn` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knowing himself to have been returned empanelled or sworn as an assessor contrary to law voluntarily serves as such assessor` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Government stamps -- Chapter 12, sections 255 to 263`

DECLARE `Government Stamp` HAS
    -- Section 255(2) -- what the stamp is
    `the stamp is a stamp issued by the Government for the purpose of revenue` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the stamp is a stamp certificate issued under the Stamp Duties Act 1929` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 255 -- counterfeiting
    `counterfeits or knowingly performs any part of the process of counterfeiting the stamp` IS A BOOLEAN
    `causes a genuine stamp of one denomination to appear like a genuine stamp of a different denomination` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 256 and 257 -- instruments and materials
    `has in his possession any instrument or material for the purpose of being used or knowing or having reason to believe that it is intended to be used for counterfeiting the stamp` IS A BOOLEAN
    `makes performs any part of the process of making buys sells or disposes of any instrument for the purpose of being used or knowing or having reason to believe that it is intended to be used for counterfeiting the stamp` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 258 to 260 -- dealing in counterfeit stamps
    `sells or offers for sale a stamp which he knows or has reason to believe to be a counterfeit of the stamp` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has in his possession a stamp which he knows to be a counterfeit of the stamp` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to use or dispose of the counterfeit as a genuine stamp or in order that it may be used as a genuine stamp` IS A BOOLEAN
    `uses as genuine a stamp knowing it to be a counterfeit of the stamp` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 261 to 263 -- reuse of genuine stamps
    `intends to cause loss to the Government` IS A BOOLEAN
    `removes or effaces from a substance bearing the stamp any writing or document for which the stamp has been used or removes from a writing or document a stamp which has been used for it in order that the stamp may be used for a different writing or document` IS A BOOLEAN
    `uses for any purpose the stamp which he knows to have been before used` IS A BOOLEAN
    `erases or removes from the stamp a mark put or impressed on it to denote that it has been used or knowingly has in his possession or sells or disposes of a stamp from which such a mark has been erased or removed or sells or disposes of a stamp which he knows to have been used` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Public tranquility -- Chapter 14, sections 267A to 268C, 290 and 291`

DECLARE `Public Nuisance` HAS
    -- Section 267A -- affray
    `two or more persons disturb the public peace by fighting in a public place and the person is one of them` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 267C -- incitement to violence or disobedience
    `utters words or makes a sign or visible representation or places before a person an object or posts publishes distributes sells or offers for sale a document or communicates an electronic record` IS A BOOLEAN
    `makes prints or otherwise reproduces imports possesses or has under his control such a document for the purpose of posting publishing distributing selling or offering it for sale or makes such an electronic record for the purpose of communicating it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the words sign representation object document or electronic record contains an incitement to violence or counsels disobedience to the law or to a lawful order of a public servant or is likely to lead to a breach of the peace` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends violence disobedience to the law or such lawful order or breach of the peace to occur` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that violence disobedience to the law or such lawful order or breach of the peace is likely to occur as a result` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends violence disobedience to the law or such lawful order or breach of the peace to occur by the carrying out of that purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that violence disobedience to the law or such lawful order or breach of the peace is likely to occur by the carrying out of that purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 268 -- public nuisance
    `does an act or is guilty of an illegal omission` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission causes common injury danger or annoyance to the public or to the people in general who dwell or occupy property in the vicinity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission must necessarily cause injury obstruction danger or annoyance to persons who may have occasion to use a public right` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 268A to 268C -- hoaxes and things causing fear of harm
    `transmits or communicates or causes to be transmitted or communicated information which contains a reference to the presence in any place or location or in any conveyance or means of transportation of a thing that is likely to cause hurt or damage to property by any means` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows that the reference is false or fabricated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `places a thing in any place or location or in any conveyance or means of transportation or sends a thing from one place to another by post courier or any other means` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has a reasonable excuse` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to induce in one or more other persons a belief that the thing is likely to cause hurt or damage to property by any means` IS A BOOLEAN
    `places or sends the thing intentionally` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows that there is a real risk that one or more persons would believe that the thing is likely to cause hurt or damage to property by any means` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 290 and 291 -- punishment and continuance of a nuisance
    `the public nuisance is otherwise punishable by this Code` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knew that the act or omission constituting the public nuisance will cause or will probably cause common injury danger or annoyance to the public or to the people in general who dwell or occupy property in the vicinity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `this is a second or subsequent conviction` IS A BOOLEAN
    `repeats or continues a public nuisance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `has been enjoined by a public servant with lawful authority to issue such an injunction not to repeat or continue the nuisance` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Public health and safety -- Chapter 14, sections 269 to 289`

DECLARE `Public Health And Safety` HAS
    -- Sections 269 and 270 -- spreading infection
    `does an act which is and which he knows or has reason to believe to be likely to spread the infection of a disease dangerous to life` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act is done unlawfully or negligently` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act is done intentionally or rashly` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 271 -- quarantine
    `knowingly disobeys a rule lawfully made and promulgated for putting a vessel into a state of quarantine or for regulating the intercourse of vessels in quarantine with the shore or with other vessels or for regulating the intercourse between places where an infectious disease prevails and other places` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 272 to 276 -- food, drink and drugs
    `adulterates an article of food or drink so as to make it noxious as food or drink` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends to sell the article as food or drink or knows it to be likely that it will be sold as food or drink` IS A BOOLEAN
    `sells or offers or exposes for sale as food or drink an article which has been rendered or has become noxious or is in a state unfit for food or drink` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows or has reason to believe that the article is noxious as food or drink` IS A BOOLEAN
    `adulterates a drug or medical preparation so as to lessen its efficacy or change its operation or make it noxious` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends that the drug or medical preparation be sold or used for or knows it to be likely that it will be sold or used for a medicinal purpose as if it had not undergone the adulteration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knows a drug or medical preparation to have been adulterated so as to lessen its efficacy change its operation or render it noxious` IS A BOOLEAN
    `sells the adulterated drug or offers or exposes it for sale or issues it from a dispensary for medicinal purposes as unadulterated or causes it to be used for medicinal purposes by a person not knowing of the adulteration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knowingly sells or offers or exposes for sale or issues from a dispensary for medicinal purposes a drug or medical preparation as a different drug or medical preparation` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 277 and 278 -- water and atmosphere
    `voluntarily corrupts or fouls the water of a public spring or reservoir so as to render it less fit for the purpose for which it is ordinarily used` IS A BOOLEAN
    `voluntarily vitiates the atmosphere in any place so as to make it noxious to the health of persons in general dwelling or carrying on business in the neighbourhood or passing along a public way` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 279 to 283 -- ways and navigation
    `drives a vehicle or rides on a public way in a manner so rash or negligent as to endanger human life or to be likely to cause hurt or injury to any other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `navigates a vessel in a manner so rash or negligent as to endanger human life or to be likely to cause hurt or injury to any other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `exhibits a false light mark or buoy` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intends or knows it to be likely that the exhibition will mislead a navigator` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knowingly or negligently conveys or causes to be conveyed for hire a person by water in a vessel which is in such a state or so loaded as to endanger the life of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by doing an act or by omitting to take order with property in his possession or under his charge causes danger obstruction or injury to a person in a public way or public line of navigation` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 284 to 289 -- the conduct
    `does with a dangerous or harmful substance including fire or anything likely to cause fire an act so rashly or negligently or omits to take such measure with such a substance in his possession as is sufficient to guard against probable danger to human life grievous hurt or hurt from it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `with fire or anything likely to cause fire rashly or negligently causes or substantially contributes to the risk of causing a fire` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a fire occurs` IS A BOOLEAN
    `deposits drops places or throws a cigarette or part of one a cigar a match stick charcoal incense embers or anything likely to cause fire in a place and a fire occurs at that place or in its vicinity within 60 minutes of that act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contrary of the section 286 presumption is proved` IS A BOOLEAN
    `does with machinery in his possession or under his care an act so rashly or negligently or omits to take such measure with such machinery as is sufficient to guard against probable danger to human life grievous hurt or hurt from it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in pulling down or repairing a building knowingly or negligently omits to take such measure as is sufficient to guard against probable danger to human life from the fall of the building or any part of it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `knowingly or negligently omits to take such measure with an animal as is sufficient to guard against probable danger to human life or probable danger of grievous hurt from the animal` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 284 to 289 -- the consequence
    `the act or omission is likely to cause hurt or injury to any other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission endangers human life` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission is likely to cause grievous hurt` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the fire causes damage to or diminishes the value or utility of property belonging to any other person or the Government` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission causes hurt or injury to any other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission causes grievous hurt to any other person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the act or omission causes the death of any other person` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Obscenity -- Chapter 14, sections 292 to 294`

DECLARE Obscenity HAS
    -- Section 292(2) and (3) and the Exception -- what an obscene object is
    `the object is an obscene book pamphlet paper drawing painting representation or figure or any other obscene object including data stored electronically that is capable of conversion to images writing or any other form of representation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the sale letting to hire distribution exhibition circulation import export conveyance of or other dealing in the object is authorised by or under written law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the object is a book pamphlet writing drawing or painting kept or used bona fide for religious purposes or a representation on or in a temple or on a car used for the conveyance of idols or kept or used for a religious purpose` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 292(1) -- the six ways
    `sells lets to hire distributes publicly exhibits or puts into circulation the obscene object by any means electronic or otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
    `makes produces or has in his possession the obscene object for the purposes of sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation by any means electronic or otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
    `imports exports or conveys the obscene object for the purposes of sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation or knowing or having reason to believe that it will be sold let to hire distributed publicly exhibited or put into circulation by any means electronic or otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
    `takes part in or receives profits from a business in the course of which he knows or has reason to believe that an obscene object is made produced purchased kept imported exported or conveyed for the purposes of sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation or is sold let to hire distributed publicly exhibited or put into circulation by any means electronic or otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
    `advertises or makes known by any means whatsoever that any person is engaged or is ready to engage in an act which is an offence under section 292 or that an obscene object can be procured from or through any person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `offers or attempts to do an act which is an offence under section 292` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 292(1A) to (1C) -- the electronic and minor aggravations
    `the dealing is by electronic means to 10 or more individuals` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the obscene object depicts an image of a person who is or who appears to a reasonable observer to be or is implied to be below 18 years of age` IS A BOOLEAN
    `on 2 or more occasions sells lets to hire distributes publicly exhibits or puts into circulation by electronic means an obscene object to a total number of 10 or more individuals` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 292A -- child sex-doll
    `imports exports conveys sells lets to hire distributes puts into circulation makes produces or is in possession of an anatomically correct doll mannequin or robot with the features of or with features that appear to a reasonable observer to resemble a person below 16 years of age and intended for use in sexual activities` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Section 292B -- obscene object on an online location
    `an obscene object is sold let for hire distributed publicly exhibited or circulated to 10 or more individuals on an online location being an internet domain website webpage chatroom channel group forum or other location accessible by means of the Internet` IS A BOOLEAN
    `develops and maintains the online location or organises manages or supervises its use or manages or regulates membership of or access to it or has the authority to decide whether material may be included or excluded on it or where to place material or otherwise exercises editorial control over it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in doing so intends that the online location be used to enable or facilitate the sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation of obscene objects generally` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Sections 293 and 294 -- young persons and obscene acts
    `sells lets to hire distributes exhibits or circulates the obscene object to a person below 21 years of age or offers or attempts to do so` IS A BOOLEAN
    `to the annoyance of others does an obscene act in a public place or sings recites or utters obscene words in or near a public place` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Offences relating to race -- Chapter 15, sections 298 and 298A`

DECLARE `Racial Offence` HAS
    `with the deliberate intention of wounding the racial feelings of a person utters any word or makes any sound in the hearing of that person or makes any gesture or places any object in the sight of that person or causes any matter however represented to be seen or heard by that person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `by words spoken or written or by signs or by visible representations or otherwise knowingly promotes or attempts to promote on grounds of race disharmony or feelings of enmity hatred or ill will between different racial groups` IS A BOOLEAN
    `commits an act which he knows is prejudicial to the maintenance of harmony between different racial groups and which disturbs or is likely to disturb the public tranquility` IS A BOOLEAN

